window.WIKI_SEARCH_INDEX = [{"slug":"mediography","title":"媒介志","book":"book1","excerpt":"直接启发《石顶》（Stonetop）的作品：游戏、博客、书籍、影视与播客，以及关于其创作者的一句提醒。","text":"媒介志\n 直接的游戏影响\n The following works directly inspired Stonetop 's mechanics, techniques, setting, themes, and approach to information design.\n Dungeon World , Adam Koebel & Sage LaTorra, Sage Kobold Productions, 2012\n Apocalypse World ，D. Vincent Baker 与 Meguey Baker，lumpley games，2010\n Storming the Wizard's Tower , D. Vincent Baker, unpublished, 2008\n Dungeons & Dragons (4th Edition), Rob Heinsoo, Andy Collins, and James Wyatt; Wizards of the Coast, 2008\n Blades in the Dark ，John Harper，Evil Hat Productions，2017\n Beyond the Wall and Other Adventures , John Cocking & Peter S. Williams, Flatland Games, 2013\n The Perilous Wilds ，Jason Lutes，Lampblack & Brimstone，2016\n 20 Dungeon Starters , Marshall Miller & Mark Tygart, Lampblack & Brimstone, 2016\n Trilemma Adventures ，Michael Prescott，Trilemma Adventures，2019\n Ars Magica , Mark Rein-Hagen & Jonathan Tweet, Lion Rampant Games, 1987\n 博客\n You can find a lot of writing about Stonetop and its development at Jeremy's blog, Spouting Lore (2018-2023). Additionally, the following essays and series either influenced techniques and approaches presented in this game or demonstrate the game in action.\n \" Apocalypse World : Crossing the Line ,\" John Harper, The Mighty Atom , 2010\n \" Paint the Scene ,\" Jason Cordova, The Gauntlet Blog , 2018\n \" The 7-3-1 Technique ,\" Jason Cordova, The Gauntlet Blog , 2018\n “ A 16 HP Dragon ”，Stras Acimovic，由 Sage LaTorra 转载，Latorra.org，2012\n \" Powered by the Apocalypse \" (12-part series), D. Vincent Baker, lumpley games , 2019-2025\n A Collection of Unmitigated Pedantry , Bret Devereaux, 2019-present (especially the \" Practical Polytheism \" series and the \" Iron, How Did They Make It? \" series)\n \" Xandering the Dungeon ,\" Justin Alexander, The Alexandrian , 2010\n “ Dungeon Checklist ”，Arnold K.， Goblin Punch \n \" PTFO: Stonetop \" (solo actual-play series), SGH, PTFO on Substack, 2022-present\n 参照作品\n There's no one thing you can point at and say \" Stonetop is just like this.\" But here's some stuff that you might look to for vibes.\n Barbarians （电视剧），Andreas Heckmann 等，Gaumont Germany，2020-2022\n The Bear and the Nightingale (book; and to a lesser extent the whole Winternight trilogy), Katherine Arden, Del Rey, 2017\n The Chronicles of Prydain (book series), Lloyd Alexander; Holt, Reinhart, and Winston; 1964-1968\n The Dark is Rising Sequence (book series), Susan Cooper, Random House, 1965-1977\n The Demon Cycle (book series), Peter V. Brett, Penguin Random House, 2010-2017\n Farseer （书三部曲），Robin Hobb，Spectra，1995-1997\n The First Law （书系列），Joe Abercrombie，Orbit Books，2006-至今\n The Hobbit （书），J.R.R. Tolkien，George Allen & Unwin，1937\n King of Dragon Pass (video game), David Dunham, A Sharp, 1999 (or anything else related to the Glorantha setting by Greg Stafford (so I'm told))\n The Last Kingdom (TV series), Stephen Butchard et al, Carnival Film and Television, 2015-2017\n Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind (film), Hayao Miyazaki, Studio Ghibli, 1984\n Northlanders （漫画系列），Brian Wood，Vertigo，2008-2012\n Princess Mononoke （电影），Hayao Miyazaki，Studio Ghibli，1984\n Redwall （书系列），Brian Jacques，Penguin Books，1986-2011\n Rome （电视剧），John Milius 等，HBO，2005-2007\n The Secret of Kells (film), Tomm Moore & Nora Twomey, Les Armateurs, 2009\n The Sharing Knife (book series), Lois McMaster Bujold, HarperCollins, 2006-2019\n Shattered Sea （书三部曲）Joe Abercrombie，Del Rey，2014-2015\n Vikings （电视剧），Michael Hirst，TM Productions 等，2013-2021\n A Wizard of Earthsea （书），Ursula K. Le Guin，Parnassus Press，1968\n The Driftless region of Wisconsin , and Texas Hill Country \n 还有……\n The following influenced or inspired certain specific elements of Stonetop , or resonate strongly with some of its themes. Maybe they'll inspire you, too.\n At the Mountains of Madness (novella), H.P. Lovecraft, Astounding Stories , 1936 (and other stories by Lovecraft)\n The Black Company （书系列），Glen Cook，1984-至今，Tor Fantasy\n Black Spot （电视剧），Mathieu Missoffe，Ego Productions 等，2017-2019\n Chronos (film), Guillermo del Toro, Fondo de Fomento Cinematográfico et al, 1992\n The \"Conan\" stories (books and adaptations); Robert E. Howard, L. Sprague de Camp, and Lin Carter; various publishers, 1950-1977 (especially \" Red Nails \")\n Deadwood （电视剧），David Milch，Roscoe Productions 等，2004-2006\n Discern Realities (podcast), Jason Cordova & David LaFrieniere, The Gauntlet, 2015-2019\n Gentleman Bastard （书系列），Scott Lynch，Bantam Books，2006-2013\n Gladiator （电影），Ridley Scott，DreamWorks Pictures 等，2000\n Heart Shaped Box （书），Joe Hill，William Morrow，2007\n Hillfolk （RPG），Robin Laws，Pelgrane Press，2013\n A History of Violence （电影），David Cronenberg，BenderSpink 等，2005\n Jonathan Strange and Mr Norrell (book), Susanna Clarke, Bloomsbury, 2004\n Legacy: Life Among the Ruins (RPG), Minerva McJanda, UFO Press, 2015\n Little House on the Prairie (book series), Laura Ingalls Wilder, Harper & Brothers, 1932-1971\n Low Country （专辑），The Sword，Razor & Tie，2016\n The Magnus Archives (podcast), Jonathan Simms & Alexander J. Newall, Rusty Quill, 2016-2021\n Mouse Guard (comic book series), David Petersen, Archaia Studios Press, 2006-present\n Monster Man （播客），James Holloway，2018-至今\n No Country for Old Kobolds (RPG), Steve Wallace, Steve Wallace Art, 2016\n Old Gods of Appalachia (podcast), Steve Shell & Cam Collins, Deepnerd Media, 2019-present\n Pan's Labyrinth （电影，2006），Guillermo del Toro，Estudios Picasso 等，2006\n Prey （电影），Dan Trachtenberg，20th Century Studios 等，2022\n The Revenant (film), Alejandro González Iñárritu, Regency Enterprises et al, 2015\n The Ritual （电影），David Bruckner，The Imaginarium，2017\n Sagas of the Icelanders （RPG），Gregor Vuga，2013\n The Secret of NIMH （电影），Don Bluth，United Artists，1982\n Under Hollow Hills (RPG), Meguey Baker & D. Vincent Baker, lumpley games, 2021\n The Wardstone Chronicles (book series), Joseph Delaney, Greenwillow Books, 2004-2013\n Caveat emptor\n 以上全部都相关，并可能作为灵感有用，但它们并不一定都好。\n And some of the creators held and espoused hurtful beliefs, which permeates their work. Others have done or been accused of terrible things. People, like art and our consumption of it, are complicated.","local":1}];
